  answer: Blind Willie Johnson
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Blind Willie Johnson
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABLord I Just Can't Keep From Crying\xBB,
    de 1928, y llega hasta 1928."
  - "\xABJesus Make Up My Dying Bed\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso
    cercano a 123 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABLet Your Light Shine on Me\xBB y \xABJohn
    the Revelator\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABIt's Nobody's Fault but Mine\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABDark Was the Night, Cold Was the Ground\xBB
    y \xABThe Soul of a Man\xBB."
